## The Early Mover, High Volume Approach

The archetype tags assigned by polymarket.tips—High Volume and Early Mover—describe a specific trading philosophy that shapes every aspect of CandleHammerDrums's activity. Early movers enter markets before consensus crystallizes, often when liquidity is thinner and spreads are wider. This requires conviction and independent analysis rather than waiting for confirming signals. The high volume tag indicates that CandleHammerDrums does not dabble; positions are sized meaningfully relative to available liquidity. Combining these two characteristics creates a profile of a trader who identifies opportunities before the crowd arrives and then commits capital decisively. The risk in this approach is obvious—being early and wrong with significant size leads to rapid losses—but the verified profit figure demonstrates that CandleHammerDrums has navigated this risk successfully across dozens of markets.

